      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Non Functional Requirements\n\n1. System should be highly available (SLA 99.999)\n\n2. System should be eventually consistent (within \n    5 seconds)\n\n3. System should be able to generate alert within\n    5 seconds ",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non Functional Requirements\n\n1. System should be highly available (SLA 99.999)\n\n2. System should be eventually consistent (within \n    5 seconds)\n\n3. System should be able to generate alert within\n    5 seconds ",
