      "text": "manage shards per\nseries\n\nhot series are recognized\nbased on the ingest rate\nand automatically sharded\ninto more than one series\n\nseries_id = hash(name, sorted(labels), salt)\n\nkeep track of active salts for given\n(name, sorted(labels))\n\n2X number of shard every time\nthe ingest rate crosses \na threshold",
